<title>USA: COMCAST SELLS REMAINING SHRS IN NEXTEL.</title>
<headline>COMCAST SELLS REMAINING SHRS IN NEXTEL.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comcast Corp said Monday that in July it sold its remaining position of about 3.3 million shares in Nextel Communications Inc for $73.4 million through open market sales.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of 1996, Comcast held $300 million in Nextel, and began selling the shares in the second quarter, Comcast said.</p>
<p>In 1997, through July 31, the company said its sales of non-strategic assets have generated more than $215 million in cash proceeds, which exceeded the company's economic investment by $138 million, Comcast said.</p>
